# ============================================
# Setup Instructions:
# ============================================
# 1. Visit https://console.groq.com
# 2. Sign up with your email (FREE)
# 3. Go to API Keys section
# 4. Create a new API key
# 5. Copy the key and paste above
# 6. Rename this file to .env
# 7. Restart your dev server

